{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_015_summary_tally_sheet_story", "label": "STORY-015: summary.py \u2014 nine StatsResponse figures as a ruled tally sheet with stated scopes", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-015-summary-tally-sheet.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_015_summary_tally_sheet_tally_sheet_structure", "label": "Ruled tally sheet structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-015-summary-tally-sheet.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The nine StatsResponse figures are set as a ruled list, not a grid of cards. blocked_duplicates and blocked_suspicious are indented beneath total_queries because they are a subset of it, and indentation states that relationship honestly where a card grid would falsely assert all figures as peers."}, {"id": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_015_summary_tally_sheet_risk4_scope_labeling", "label": "Risk 4: scope labeling avoids contradiction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/stories/PRD-006-admin-console/STORY-015-summary-tally-sheet.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A summary that says '3,180 queries' beside a register showing 100 rows reads as a contradiction unless every figure states its scope \u2014 all-time over the whole table versus the register's last-100 window. The completion label is additionally pinned by a copy test so its wording cannot regress to 'success rate'."}], "edges": [{"source": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_015_summary_tally_sheet_story", "target": "_agents_stories_prd_006_admin_console_story_002_verdict_derivation_formatting_story", "re